  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Schedule</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
          <h1>Private tuning and tailored sessions</h1>
          <p class="small">Book a focused, one-to-one encounter for therapeutic support, deeper rest, or group sessions for small teams. Sessions are customizable: sound-led, talk-and-tone, or a mixed approach oriented to your needs.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="pill">One-to-One</div>
            <div style="height:8px"></div>
            <div class="note">60–90 minute sessions designed for deeper exploration. Facilitator adapts instruments and pacing to your sensitivities and goals.</div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">How a private session flows</h3>
          <ol class="small" style="margin:0 0 8px 0;padding-left:18px">
            <li>Brief intake about health, goals, and comfort with volume.</li>
            <li>Guided settling and choice of anchors (breath, body, point of focus).</li>
            <li>Sound sequence tailored to your nervous system for 30–60 min.</li>
            <li>Slow reintegration and suggestions for follow-up practices.</li>
          </ol>
          <div class="note">A private option is a safer alternative if you have strong sensitivity to communal sound or health contraindications.</div>
        </section>

        <section class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Contraindications & safety</h3>
          <p class="small">Please avoid or consult a clinician about attending if you have implanted electronic medical devices, recent surgery, or uncontrolled cardiovascular conditions. If you have concern about seizures, inner-ear conditions, pregnancy-related issues, or strong sound sensitivity, contact us first at {{PHONE}} or {{EMAIL}}. We will adapt or recommend an alternative approach when needed.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside>
        <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
          <div style="font-weight:700">Session types</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Inner Map — 60 min</div>
              <div class="small">Intake, guided sound, integration.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Household Field — 75 min</div>
              <div class="small">Shared session for 2–4 people; group dynamics included.</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Short Resonance — 30 min</div>
              <div class="small">Focused reset for busy days; short, gentle work.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px"><a href="book.html" class="btn">Request a private time</a></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:12px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Preparation tips</div>
          <ul class="small" style="margin:8px 0 0 18px;padding:0">
            <li>Wear comfortable layers and consider a blanket.</li>
            <li>Hydrate lightly; avoid heavy meals before arrival.</li>
            <li>Share any medical conditions on booking form.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:12px">
          <div style="font-weight:700">Contact</div>
          <div class="small" style="margin-top:8px">For scheduling & questions: <br><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a><br><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Follow-up micro-habits</h3>
      <p class="small">Three short practices to weave what you received into the coming days.</p>
      <ol class="small" style="padding-left:18px;margin:0.8em 0">
        <li>Daily 2-minute breath pause on waking.</li>
        <li>One evening note: what shifted today? (a single line)</li>
        <li>Choose one phrase from your session to repeat when stressed.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="small">{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Reuse scroll reveal (duplicated logic to ensure independent load)
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const revealables = document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]');
      if(prefersReduced){ revealables.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible')); return; }
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{ entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(e.target); } }); },{threshold:0.08});
      revealables.forEach(el=>io.observe(el));
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"pricing.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Rates — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#081212;--card:#0f1b1a;--muted:#9fcfc6;--accent:#7ed9c9;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial}
    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#eaf8f4}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:16px 22px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:220px}
    nav a{color:#cfeee7;margin-left:16px;text-decoration:none}
    .container{max-width:1024px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}
    .intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}
    .plan-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-top:14px}
    .plan{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    .price{font-weight:800;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px}
    .small{color:#9fbfb5}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#03211f;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    @media (max-width:900px){.plan-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Schedule</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="card">
      <div class="intro">
        <div>
          <h1 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Simple pricing, transparent offerings</h1>
          <div class="small">Choose between open gatherings, a commitment series, or private work. Each tier emphasizes different rhythms and access.</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:right">
          <div class="small">Payments via card. Gift certificates available.</div>
          <a href="book.html" class="btn" style="margin-top:8px;display:inline-block">Start a booking</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card" style="margin-top:16px">
      <div style="font-weight:700">Offerings</div>
